["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Living with uncertainty need for cognitive closure aporia why chaining\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-startweek-保健品卖的不是疗效-是替你承受不确定性/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>保健品卖的不是疗效，是替你承受不确定性</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全球每年花60亿美元买更年期补充剂，英国同年只花6000万研究更年期；胶原蛋白从每公斤15英镑的屠宰废料变成货架上300英镑的美容品。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">健康消费</span><span class=\"tag\">补充剂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Adam Conover explains how YouTube ruined everything in the black vaporware upfronts AVOD\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-decoder-youtube-是比电视台更糟的守门人-因为你没法跟算法谈判/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e9e71199cd5ad416-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>YouTube 是比电视台更糟的守门人，因为你没法跟算法谈判</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">喜剧演员 Adam Conover 说，好莱坞为了追 Netflix 亲手毁掉有线电视，把游戏节目、日间秀、生活类节目整片让给 YouTube；而 YouTube 的算法是个无法交涉、无法施压的守门人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创作者经济</span><span class=\"tag\">YouTube</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI President Greg Brockman on Doing Business in the Wake of Hugging Face chain of thought monitorability reward hacking grader preparedness framework responsible scaling policy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-oddlots-openai-总裁承认-安全标准要提前到训练阶段/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 总裁承认：安全标准要提前到训练阶段</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hugging Face 事件后，OpenAI 把安全审查从部署阶段前移到开发与评测阶段，并放慢了部分训练运行——这是它自己说的最大转折点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Thrive Causemetics: Karissa Bodnar. How a Beauty Business Made Millions for a Mission direct-to-consumer term sheet co-manufacturer one for one\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-howibuilt-美妆品牌靠使命卖货-其实产品才是命根子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">48:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>美妆品牌靠使命卖货，其实产品才是命根子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Thrive Causemetics 先做出一款给化疗掉睫毛的人用的假睫毛，再靠一条 iPhone 广告在七天内把日销从 5000 美元推到 10 万美元。创始人说，使命决定复购，但产品决定生死。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">D2C</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20VC: How LPs Allocate to Venture in 2026: What They Want, What They Do Not Want | Why Fund Multiple Does Not Matter Without a Timeline | Why Velocity of Cashback is the Most Important Thing with David Morehead, CIO @ Baylor velocity of capital fund of one J curve commingled fund denominator effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-twentyvc-大学捐赠基金-cio-基金年限太长-gp-和我们的数学根本不一致/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c5f22493ad40ee05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>大学捐赠基金 CIO：基金年限太长，GP 和我们的数学根本不一致</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">私募存在的唯一理由就是赚钱——但 15 到 18 年的基金期限让 GP 的激励和捐赠基金的复利数学错位。真正该追的不是资本回报率，而是资本周转速度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LP视角</span><span class=\"tag\">资产配置</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Norway’s teacher resistance in World War Two Quisling Quisling Youth Service Gestapo\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-witness-挪威教师拒绝教纳粹课-占领者输掉了学校/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>挪威教师拒绝教纳粹课，占领者输掉了学校</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">德国四周拿下挪威南部，却四年没能拿下挪威的课堂：14000名教师中12000人拒绝加入纳粹教师工会，1000多人被送进集中营，回来后仍不是会员。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">二战</span><span class=\"tag\">挪威</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"#407 ‒ Preventing cardiovascular and Alzheimer&#x27;s disease: lowering LDL early, APOE4, and promising new therapies | Michael Davidson, M.D. CETP APOE4 P-tau 217 MFSD2A lysoPC DHA Lp(a)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-thepeterattiad-把-ldl-压到-80-以下-可能一辈子不得心脏病/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d415dc8503c1c8f1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Peter Attia Drive</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>把 LDL 压到 80 以下，可能一辈子不得心脏病</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">8 克法则：LDL 200 撑 40 年、100 撑 80 年、80 撑 100 年，累计都是 8 克胆固醇。心梗前降最有效，心衰后再降就没用了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>12</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心血管</span><span class=\"tag\">阿尔茨海默</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Home Depot rapid deployment center market delivery operations direct fulfillment center stack &#x27;em high, watch &#x27;em fly Six Sigma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-acquired-home-depot-上市以来回报第一-靠的不是卖便宜货/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a629c40221e1a9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:35:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>Home Depot 上市以来回报第一，靠的不是卖便宜货</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">它把教育打包进零售：顾客问怎么修，店员就停下来教。25 美分的垫圈能带出十万美元的厨房翻新，这种价值没法用 Six Sigma 表格管理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零售</span><span class=\"tag\">供应链</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 400: Dennett Rejects Qualia (Part One) qualia Cartesian theater access consciousness multiple drafts model center of gravity heterophenomenology\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-pel-丹尼特否认感受质-颜色不在外面-也不在里面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2f8ad674feef51a4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>丹尼特否认感受质：颜色不在外面，也不在里面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">丹尼特不否认我们觉得有感受质，他否认的是感受质这个被实体化的东西存在——就像重心是抽象，不是身体里的一个点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">意识哲学</span><span class=\"tag\">丹尼特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The KGB Double Agent Who Stopped Armageddon with Ben McIntyre MICE RockX Minox Tudeh Party brush contact dead drop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-historyhit-一个苏联间谍的难言之隐-差点阻止了第三次世界大战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1f92a8a9105bdcbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">41:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>一个苏联间谍的难言之隐，差点阻止了第三次世界大战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1981年，克格勃驻德黑兰高官主动向MI6投诚，动机不是钱也不是意识形态，而是他相信西方能治好他的性功能障碍——他交出的情报，让美英决定把苏联政变计划交给伊朗人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战</span><span class=\"tag\">间谍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"646: The Secret of My Death Memento Mori medevac frogman\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-tal-死后你留下的不是死因-是别人拼凑的你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/25f52c21084864d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>死后你留下的不是死因，是别人拼凑的你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三个故事都在做同一件事：人死后，亲友只能靠短信、讣告、Facebook 留言这些零碎证据去还原一个已经无法开口的人——而拼出来的那个版本，往往和本人认知完全对不上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">叙事播客</span><span class=\"tag\">死亡</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Neurodiversity, Autism, Awe, and Religious Experience (with Jonathan Machnee) neurodivergent profound autism cognitive dissonance pressure cooker collective effervescence double empathy problem cessationism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-clearerthink-自闭症不是一条线-是十维谱系加四个遗传簇/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:35:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>自闭症不是一条线，是十维谱系加四个遗传簇</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DSM-5 把马斯克和无法自己穿衣服的人塞进同一个桶，但自闭症没有生物标志物，只有四个遗传簇和一堆被误读的标签。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神经多样性</span><span class=\"tag\">自闭症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"E199 AI投研的边界、能力与实战卡点 I David对话岗底斯首席 FDE FDE MOE Harness ETL QA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-touzishizhan-ai-不会让普通人变优秀-只会让优秀的人更优秀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84ddf31325c222e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不会让普通人变优秀，只会让优秀的人更优秀</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投研 Agent 的卡点不在模型，在数据治理和人的判断力；用海外模型会让你越来越笨，用国内模型逼你越来越聪明。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI投研</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"705. Queen Victoria’s Revenge: The Mad Emperor of Abyssinia (Part 1) Abyssinia Magdala Theodros II Hormuzd Rassam Walter Plowden Charles Duncan Cameron\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-restishistory-英国远征阿比西尼亚-一个皇帝把外交官全扣了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>英国远征阿比西尼亚：一个皇帝把外交官全扣了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">维多利亚女王没回一封信，特沃德罗斯二世就把英国领事、传教士全锁进马格达拉山顶，等来的是一支远征军。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">帝国史</span><span class=\"tag\">埃塞俄比亚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Silicon Valley’s Starving for Compute Neocloud Neolab reticle panel level packaging RSI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-asianometry-2027-年算力会从短缺变成过剩-ai-泡沫未必破/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bde50d837c58c490-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">21:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>2027 年算力会从短缺变成过剩，AI 泡沫未必破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年底可用 AI 数据中心约 15 吉瓦，2027 年底冲到 45-55 吉瓦，增量 30-40 吉瓦。按每吉瓦 500 亿美元收入算，两家巨头要做出 7500 亿到 1.5 万亿美元，这个数字站不住。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">半导体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"395. Stalin: The Rise of A Tyrant (Part 1) Koba Bolsheviks / Mensheviks Russification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-empirehist-斯大林在革命里只是个管账的-后来却成了总书记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">33:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>斯大林在革命里只是个管账的，后来却成了总书记</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1917年列宁和托洛茨基在街头号召起义时，斯大林在做没人愿意干的组织与筹款工作。他后来成为总书记，靠的不是演说，而是坐在桌边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">苏联史</span><span class=\"tag\">权力结构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"8 Ways To Improve Your Outbound Sales outbound intent signals breakup message deliverability Sales Navigator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-ycsp-外联回复率接近零-先别怪文案-先查你在发给谁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b47caf90a5aa280a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">12:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>外联回复率接近零，先别怪文案，先查你在发给谁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">外联像大海捞针：人不对，再完美的文案也不会落地。YC 合伙人给出的调试顺序是——先查收件人、再查公司、再看标题，最后才轮到文案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">外联销售</span><span class=\"tag\">早期创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"World Models, Robotics, and the Future of 3D AI world model Gaussian splat real to sim bullet time SFT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-a16z-世界模型不是视频生成-atlas-把-3d-控制做成了输入/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是视频生成：Atlas 把 3D 控制做成了输入</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">语言模型处理 token，世界模型处理物理空间。Atlas 的关键不是生成更长的视频，而是把相机和参考图放进 3D 坐标里当输入，让生成从老虎机变成导演。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">3D 生成</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"HoP 499 Beyond Belief: Bayle, Toleration, and Atheism invincible ignorance Manichaeism Theophrastus Redivivus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-hopwag-第一个公开的无神论者-其实是个不敢出书的乡村神父/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">23:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>第一个公开的无神论者，其实是个不敢出书的乡村神父</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">梅利耶写下了否定上帝存在的《遗书》，却只敢抄三份留给身后；贝尔则用怀疑论证明，宗教问题超出理性，因此没人有资格以信仰之名迫害他人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>19</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">无神论</span><span class=\"tag\">宗教宽容</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1357: Furin, Naturally with Paul Bieinasz furin cleavage site NSP15 RXXR sarbecovirus OC43\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-twiv-造一个-furin-位点根本不难-难的是承认它不罕见/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">T</div><span class=\"dur\">1:44:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>造一个 furin 位点根本不难，难的是承认它不罕见</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">深度测序显示，冠状病毒基因组里每千个就有几个带插入，furin 位点在同一位置至少被独立撞上三次——实验室起源论的概率论证站不住脚。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">病毒学</span><span class=\"tag\">深度测序</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The First Punic War corvus Mamertines Mix-Hellenes Monte Fortino\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-ancients-罗马的胜利靠一只乌鸦-第一次布匿战争的关键/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e86106fe99ba32a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>罗马的胜利靠一只乌鸦：第一次布匿战争的关键</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">罗马靠一种叫 corvus 的登船吊桥把海战变成陆战，抵消了迦太基的水手优势；但迦太基请来一位斯巴达人重整军队，反手俘虏了罗马执政官。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古代史</span><span class=\"tag\">罗马</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"92. Is Poor Nutrition a Supply Problem or a Demand Problem? food desert external locus of control Nielsen Home Scan\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-13-nostupid-开一家新超市-只解决-10-的营养不平等/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">32:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0913</span></div>\n<h2>开一家新超市，只解决 10% 的营养不平等</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把健康食品的供给铺到低收入社区，只能缩小约 10% 的营养不平等，剩下 90% 由需求端决定——而需求是可以被税收和文化改变的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行为经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">公共政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"363: Why Vegetables Are Good for Your Heart settle plate DNIC EPR sGC mTORC1\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-thisweekinmicr-本生灯不减少平板污染-蔬菜护心另有机制/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/edf553b27ee2c1ff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Microbiology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>本生灯不减少平板污染，蔬菜护心另有机制</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">本生灯在低污染环境下反而可能增加沉降菌落；蔬菜护心可能不是硝酸盐-亚硝酸盐-NO 通路，而是肠道菌把硝酸盐和铁做成 DNIC 直接激活 sGC。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">微生物学</span><span class=\"tag\">无菌操作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"We Asked Fidelity&#x27;s Ex-President What Made Peter Lynch Great — and Where Private Credit Risk Hides private credit affiliated investments rating shopping auto-IRA reversion to the mean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-12-excessreturns-私募信贷的风险藏在保险公司的评级里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3cac5e72b6049e76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Excess Returns</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0912</span></div>\n<h2>私募信贷的风险藏在保险公司的评级里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">私募信贷大量进入保险公司，且多为关联方投资，评级由私营机构给出、系统性偏高；若按正确评级，保险公司每年要多留 4000-5000 亿美元资本。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">私募信贷</span><span class=\"tag\">保险公司</span>\n</div></div></a>"]